<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-JALABERT WINS 13TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-JALABERT WINS 13TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS DE COVADONGA, Spain 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laurent Jalabert of France won the 13th stage of the Tour of Spain over 170 kilometres between Oviedo and Lagos de Covadonga on Friday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall race lead.</p>
</text>
